GitHub main b1ec57c (GitLab dac2adfc), 46 files, all under tools/vscode-htdesigner. ES02 (EastSun's laptop, the
other account) built on the machine's tools 0001-0134; it pushes to GitLab, the laptop makes the package (see
HANDOVER.md section 10). Checked file by file, CRLF to LF first: 23 the same, 8 new, 2 changed only on the laptop
(run_all.ps1 / vscode_it.ps1), 13 changed on both sides -- each of those is the machine's last version with ES02's
edits added, nothing of the machine's left out. Taken as delivered:
- 0.134 tab sheets (TTabSheet) as nodes in the component tree; 0.135 the toolbox places onto a tab sheet;
- 0.136 Alt-drag / tree drag into a tab sheet; 0.137 Find in Files over the C++ / web / BCB6 trees;
- 0.138 Solution Explorer; the parameter-type check before adding an event (lib/cpptypes.js);
- Edge 154 headless: bring the tab to the front, then poll; push_tools.ps1 says NOT pushed when a push is refused.
HANDOVER.md: section 5 -- designer-only laptop packages are merged by the designer session, how; section 3 --
e2e_build.ps1 starts wb_serve, never run on the machine without EastSun.
Tests on the machine: probe 7/7 + tab-sheet tree 7/7, extension 207/207, panels all pass; lib 173/174 -- the one is
the IO table's Alias check: D:\HT9045\system\IO_Table.csv (changed 20261001 15:05) has a marker row
#NEW_FROM_9050_DRAWING_20260923, the same on the laptop, not code. e2e_build.ps1 not run (it starts wb_serve).

